      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Omento-mesentral myxoid hamartoma, a very rare lesion seen in children, is reported in a three year old child. Its rarity, problem in its clinical pre-operative diagnosis, its characteristic gross and microscopic features, its benign, non recurrent clinical course is stressed."},
